WEBVTT

00:00:01.056 --> 00:00:07.466
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.236 --> 00:00:15.296
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.676 --> 00:00:21.116
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:26.276
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.686 --> 00:00:33.176
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.356 --> 00:00:37.156
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:44.126
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.436 --> 00:00:52.236
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.406 --> 00:00:59.476
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.686 --> 00:01:05.716
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.726 --> 00:01:11.686
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.696 --> 00:01:19.106
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.776 --> 00:01:27.046
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:31.446 --> 00:01:32.546
Correct...

00:01:32.646 --> 00:01:34.986
The three countries
other than Cephiro...

00:01:37.786 --> 00:01:38.986
Autozam.

00:01:41.026 --> 00:01:42.086
Chizeta.

00:01:45.296 --> 00:01:46.626
And Fahren.

00:01:47.866 --> 00:01:48.886
Autozam...

00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:50.636
Chizeta...

00:01:51.206 --> 00:01:52.326
Fahren...

00:01:53.236 --> 00:01:54.866
Bestow Magic!

00:02:11.826 --> 00:02:12.846
Presea!

00:02:14.396 --> 00:02:15.486
Presea!

00:02:15.726 --> 00:02:16.886
Presea!

00:02:17.196 --> 00:02:18.256
Hikaru!

00:02:26.576 --> 00:02:29.066
These swords are the ones we...

00:02:29.176 --> 00:02:32.406
Yes, the weapons that you evolved.

00:02:33.576 --> 00:02:37.916
Legendary Magic Knights!

00:03:00.376 --> 00:03:01.706
FTO...

00:03:02.776 --> 00:03:03.866
Go.

00:03:06.616 --> 00:03:07.806
It's coming!

00:03:15.386 --> 00:03:16.516
Hikaru!

00:03:16.626 --> 00:03:17.816
Ms. Hikaru!

00:03:23.626 --> 00:03:26.656
I will protect Cephiro!

00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:35.626
Autozam's Invasion and Lantis

00:03:59.696 --> 00:04:02.796
Are you planning to invade Cephiro?

00:04:05.206 --> 00:04:06.536
That's true...

00:04:07.006 --> 00:04:10.706
From your perspective,
we, the people of Autozam...

00:04:11.106 --> 00:04:14.076
...are nothing but invaders.

00:04:19.746 --> 00:04:21.716
Winds of Protection!

00:04:25.626 --> 00:04:27.816
It doesn't move like a Rune-God.

00:04:27.926 --> 00:04:30.156
It seems more mechanical...

00:04:44.246 --> 00:04:45.176
Shield.

00:04:50.186 --> 00:04:51.116
What?

00:04:56.156 --> 00:04:58.676
It is the same as my
Winds of Protection!

00:04:58.786 --> 00:05:01.886
Cephiro belongs
to the people of this land!

00:05:02.556 --> 00:05:04.226
I won't let you have it!

00:05:06.426 --> 00:05:08.896
Flame Arrow!

00:05:15.976 --> 00:05:17.096
What?

00:05:19.776 --> 00:05:21.576
So that's magic...

00:05:22.246 --> 00:05:26.576
Magic, said to be used only
by the strong-willed of Cephiro...

00:05:30.986 --> 00:05:33.616
Nothing less from
the legendary Magic Knights.

00:05:33.726 --> 00:05:37.926
This is only the second time
the FTO's scramble sign has lit up.

00:05:38.696 --> 00:05:41.456
It was nice meeting you, Magic Knights.

00:05:44.206 --> 00:05:45.326
Wait!

00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:48.606
We'll see each other again soon.

00:05:49.236 --> 00:05:51.766
But next time,
it won't be for greetings.

00:05:51.876 --> 00:05:53.506
It'll be for real.

00:05:54.976 --> 00:05:56.416
Until next time.

00:06:00.186 --> 00:06:01.176
He's fast...

00:06:02.416 --> 00:06:04.476
I cannot see him anymore.

00:06:04.586 --> 00:06:09.046
So that was one of the foreign
armies about to invade Cephiro?

00:06:09.156 --> 00:06:11.596
Eagle of Autozam...

00:06:44.866 --> 00:06:45.956
Rayearth...

00:06:46.226 --> 00:06:47.326
Selece...

00:06:47.566 --> 00:06:48.626
Windam...

00:06:49.066 --> 00:06:50.996
Protect Cephiro with us.

00:06:52.866 --> 00:06:56.466
I see. We have this armor
when we're not in the Rune-Gods.

00:06:58.206 --> 00:07:00.146
You weren't hurt, were you?

00:07:01.316 --> 00:07:02.606
That voice...

00:07:11.556 --> 00:07:12.616
Ferio!

00:07:13.896 --> 00:07:15.086
Ferio!

00:07:16.356 --> 00:07:19.656
Ferio, you're all right! I'm so glad!

00:07:19.766 --> 00:07:21.496
Are you okay yourself?

00:07:21.596 --> 00:07:23.366
Yeah, don't worry.

00:07:27.636 --> 00:07:28.606
Fuu...

00:07:29.876 --> 00:07:32.306
You are... all right...

00:07:33.676 --> 00:07:35.006
Yeah.

00:07:36.176 --> 00:07:38.376
But, Ferio, your outfit...

00:07:39.816 --> 00:07:41.576
It doesn't look good?

00:07:41.916 --> 00:07:43.886
I'm not saying that.

00:07:44.256 --> 00:07:46.686
You look like a prince
from a picture book!

00:07:46.786 --> 00:07:47.726
Yeah, yeah!

00:07:47.826 --> 00:07:50.126
That's what I wanted to say!

00:07:55.196 --> 00:07:57.296
I-I'm sorry, Ferio...

00:07:57.666 --> 00:08:00.226
Did I say something wrong?

00:08:01.636 --> 00:08:02.576
Nope.

00:08:04.046 --> 00:08:04.976
Meow!

00:08:05.376 --> 00:08:07.506
I still haven't thanked you yet...

00:08:10.886 --> 00:08:14.546
Legendary Magic Knights who
were summoned from another world...

00:08:15.216 --> 00:08:16.586
For saving Cephiro...

00:08:16.686 --> 00:08:17.616
No...

00:08:18.656 --> 00:08:21.246
For granting my elder
sister's wish, I thank you.

00:08:21.826 --> 00:08:22.756
Sister?

00:08:22.856 --> 00:08:25.486
Then, Ferio,
you're Princess Emeraude's...

00:08:25.596 --> 00:08:27.026
...little brother?

00:08:28.336 --> 00:08:31.666
Princess Emeraude
was my only elder sibling.

00:08:32.036 --> 00:08:33.806
Then you really are a prince...

00:08:33.806 --> 00:08:34.536
Then you really are a prince...
Why didn't you tell us?

00:08:34.536 --> 00:08:35.906
Why didn't you tell us?

00:08:36.876 --> 00:08:39.706
It was something
that even I had forgotten.

00:08:39.806 --> 00:08:41.076
Forgotten?

00:08:42.276 --> 00:08:44.476
I lost my memory early on.

00:08:44.586 --> 00:08:47.556
I thought that I was
all alone my entire life.

00:08:48.356 --> 00:08:52.316
My memory came back
when you defeated Inouva.

00:09:00.066 --> 00:09:01.226
Fuu...

00:09:01.536 --> 00:09:05.626
Then I... killed your...

00:09:09.676 --> 00:09:11.466
Don't cry, Fuu.

00:09:16.986 --> 00:09:19.886
Right before the Pillar
of Cephiro disappeared...

00:09:19.986 --> 00:09:22.076
...I heard my sister's voice.

00:09:23.926 --> 00:09:26.486
Please! I am about to disappear.

00:09:27.156 --> 00:09:31.026
Soon my heart will fill
with vengeance and murder.

00:09:31.526 --> 00:09:33.296
And if that happens...

00:09:33.396 --> 00:09:38.696
...I am sure to pray for Cephiro's
complete destruction and annihilation!

00:09:51.316 --> 00:09:52.546
Zagato...

00:09:53.856 --> 00:09:57.516
Finally, I am yours and only yours.

00:10:02.056 --> 00:10:05.516
Even though it was her
final moments, she seemed happy...

00:10:05.626 --> 00:10:09.566
...that she could pray only for
the man she loved, not as the Pillar.

00:10:10.306 --> 00:10:11.396
Ferio...

00:10:13.466 --> 00:10:16.166
What happiness is
depends on who you are.

00:10:16.276 --> 00:10:19.036
You shouldn't blame
yourselves for what happened.

00:10:19.146 --> 00:10:20.266
Ferio!

00:10:20.816 --> 00:10:23.776
Didn't you hear
my sister's last words?

00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:27.546
She said, "Thank you"...

00:10:30.086 --> 00:10:32.746
That's how she truly felt.

00:10:38.866 --> 00:10:42.266
Well, let's go.
Everyone's been waiting to see you.

00:10:42.736 --> 00:10:46.466
Oh, we've seen Clef
and Presea. Mokona too.

00:10:47.076 --> 00:10:49.906
There are others
who are waiting for you.

00:11:09.756 --> 00:11:11.056
In here.

00:11:30.516 --> 00:11:35.616
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:37.526 --> 00:11:41.656
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:54.236 --> 00:11:57.176
Long time no see, missies!

00:11:58.046 --> 00:11:58.606
Oh my!

00:11:58.606 --> 00:11:59.976
Oh my!
Caldina!

00:12:00.946 --> 00:12:02.776
Caldina, you're all right!

00:12:02.876 --> 00:12:05.316
You look as cheerful as ever, Hikaru.

00:12:07.386 --> 00:12:08.876
Lafarga too!

00:12:12.026 --> 00:12:15.146
Thank goodness.
You were all in the castle.

00:12:15.256 --> 00:12:16.626
Everyone is safe.

00:12:16.726 --> 00:12:21.166
Every inhabitant of Cephiro
has evacuated to this castle.

00:12:24.736 --> 00:12:28.606
But if all the buildings
have disappeared...

00:12:28.706 --> 00:12:31.696
...why is this castle still here?

00:12:31.806 --> 00:12:37.406
It was made by all the sorcerers and
summoners led by Master Mage Clef...

00:12:37.516 --> 00:12:41.146
...namely, through the power
of those with strong wills.

00:12:41.256 --> 00:12:43.156
The power of their wills?

00:12:44.926 --> 00:12:47.186
However, it will not last long.

00:12:47.826 --> 00:12:48.916
Yeah...

00:12:49.326 --> 00:12:53.026
It's the end
if Cephiro itself disappears.

00:12:58.666 --> 00:13:02.006
Don't stand in the corner
like that. Come over here!

00:13:04.446 --> 00:13:05.566
Sheesh...

00:13:07.076 --> 00:13:07.976
Hurry up!

00:13:07.976 --> 00:13:08.616
Hurry up!
It's okay.

00:13:08.616 --> 00:13:09.976
It's not okay.
It's okay.

00:13:09.976 --> 00:13:10.716
It's not okay.
It's really okay!

00:13:10.716 --> 00:13:12.086
Just hurry up!
It's really okay!

00:13:12.086 --> 00:13:13.046
Just hurry up!
B-But...

00:13:13.146 --> 00:13:14.746
What are you sayin'?

00:13:15.116 --> 00:13:17.556
You finally get to see her again.

00:13:22.956 --> 00:13:26.056
Your clothes look like
what Ascot was wearing...

00:13:26.166 --> 00:13:28.326
Are you a summoner too?

00:13:28.596 --> 00:13:29.826
U-Um...

00:13:31.166 --> 00:13:33.656
What are you bein'
so silly for already?

00:13:33.766 --> 00:13:35.606
This kid is Ascot.

00:13:35.706 --> 00:13:36.936
What?

00:13:37.976 --> 00:13:39.206
You're joking!

00:13:39.576 --> 00:13:43.346
I mean, when I last
saw him, he was this tall!

00:13:45.316 --> 00:13:47.546
Ascot grew all for you...

00:13:47.656 --> 00:13:49.146
C-Caldina!

00:13:52.826 --> 00:13:53.986
What?

00:13:57.196 --> 00:14:00.356
But you sure grew up, Ascot.

00:14:01.336 --> 00:14:04.326
I can't look at your eyes
without looking up now.

00:14:12.776 --> 00:14:14.076
I thought I was gonna die!

00:14:14.076 --> 00:14:15.336
I thought I was gonna die!
S-Sorry.

00:14:16.846 --> 00:14:20.006
By the way,
what happened to that old lady?

00:14:20.446 --> 00:14:21.746
Old lady?

00:14:21.856 --> 00:14:25.946
Yeah, that old lady sorceress
named Alcyone or something.

00:14:27.056 --> 00:14:28.146
Umi...

00:14:28.426 --> 00:14:30.446
Old lady, old lady...

00:14:30.626 --> 00:14:34.356
I feel bad for that old lady,
even if it's the truth.

00:14:34.866 --> 00:14:37.456
We do not know where Alcyone is.

00:14:39.206 --> 00:14:42.966
Nobody has seen
her since that battle.

00:14:43.876 --> 00:14:44.996
I see.

00:14:45.446 --> 00:14:48.106
I wonder if she has
gone off somewhere...

00:14:50.216 --> 00:14:51.836
But I'm glad.

00:14:52.916 --> 00:14:55.316
Because I got to see you all again.

00:14:58.986 --> 00:15:02.216
There is no Pillar
in Cephiro right now.

00:15:05.096 --> 00:15:09.586
I don't know why
we were summoned here again...

00:15:10.436 --> 00:15:17.166
But we'll fight for this country that
Princess Emeraude protected for so long!

00:15:55.876 --> 00:15:57.276
Are you hurt?

00:15:58.246 --> 00:16:00.446
This is not my blood.

00:16:02.256 --> 00:16:04.686
This voice...
I've heard it somewhere...

00:16:04.786 --> 00:16:06.276
Like he said...

00:16:09.026 --> 00:16:11.616
This isn't Lantis's blood!

00:16:11.726 --> 00:16:13.356
A-A fairy?

00:16:13.826 --> 00:16:16.456
Yup, I'm Primera, a fairy.

00:16:16.966 --> 00:16:18.726
And this is Lantis.

00:16:21.706 --> 00:16:23.136
Wait a minute!

00:16:28.946 --> 00:16:30.706
I'm Hikaru Shidou.

00:16:31.016 --> 00:16:32.416
Umi Ryuuzaki.

00:16:32.516 --> 00:16:34.676
My name is Fuu Hououji.

00:16:37.986 --> 00:16:41.386
So you three are
the legendary Magic Knights.

00:16:41.856 --> 00:16:45.816
Lantis, if you aren't hurt,
where is that blood from?

00:16:47.066 --> 00:16:50.766
This is the blood of monsters
that remain on this world.

00:16:50.906 --> 00:16:51.766
Monsters?

00:16:51.866 --> 00:16:53.306
They still exist?

00:16:53.606 --> 00:16:57.366
The monsters of Cephiro
are manifestations of the heart.

00:16:58.106 --> 00:17:02.736
Given Cephiro's current condition,
no one could be unconcerned.

00:17:03.716 --> 00:17:04.836
I see...

00:17:05.946 --> 00:17:07.646
And this lady here?

00:17:07.756 --> 00:17:10.416
It seems she didn't evacuate in time.

00:17:10.856 --> 00:17:15.116
Yep, Lantis sensed her presence
from the castle and went to save her.

00:17:16.026 --> 00:17:17.996
You are hurt after all.

00:17:22.236 --> 00:17:24.166
Fuu, your magic.

00:17:24.266 --> 00:17:25.196
Right.

00:17:26.806 --> 00:17:28.066
No!

00:17:31.476 --> 00:17:34.236
Hey, don't touch Lantis!

00:17:39.246 --> 00:17:41.406
I'll heal Lantis's wounds!

00:17:46.056 --> 00:17:48.316
Futura!

00:17:58.666 --> 00:18:00.536
You're amazing, Primera!

00:18:02.876 --> 00:18:05.536
I'm a fairy. This is a piece of cake.

00:18:07.406 --> 00:18:09.006
Take care of her.

00:18:09.846 --> 00:18:10.836
Lantis!

00:18:17.016 --> 00:18:21.216
Why didn't you report that there were
people who had not evacuated?

00:18:25.996 --> 00:18:28.396
It wasn't worth mentioning.

00:18:39.406 --> 00:18:40.936
Wait, Lantis!

00:18:49.516 --> 00:18:52.516
What are you doing, you fluff ball?

00:18:53.186 --> 00:18:54.156
Jeez!

00:18:55.056 --> 00:18:56.826
Get out of my way!

00:18:56.926 --> 00:18:58.686
Get out of my way!

00:19:07.306 --> 00:19:10.506
Jeez, you made me
lose track of Lantis!

00:19:14.516 --> 00:19:15.636
That voice...

00:19:16.576 --> 00:19:19.016
I remember hearing it somewhere...

00:19:19.716 --> 00:19:21.646
You should recognize it.

00:19:21.956 --> 00:19:25.816
Lantis over there is the younger
brother of High Priest Zagato.

00:19:26.526 --> 00:19:28.046
Younger brother?

00:19:28.156 --> 00:19:29.246
Zagato's?

00:19:30.256 --> 00:19:32.756
I was surprised at first too.

00:19:32.866 --> 00:19:35.666
I mean, his voice
is exactly like Zagato's.

00:19:36.436 --> 00:19:39.196
I didn't know Zagato
had a younger brother...

00:19:39.806 --> 00:19:43.896
We didn't meet him when
we were last summoned here.

00:19:44.276 --> 00:19:45.206
Yeah.

00:19:45.946 --> 00:19:51.846
Lantis had left this land quite a while
before you were summoned here.

00:19:52.586 --> 00:19:54.016
Left Cephiro?

00:19:54.616 --> 00:19:55.646
Why?

00:19:56.056 --> 00:19:57.846
We do not know why.

00:19:57.956 --> 00:20:02.446
All we know is that by the time
I started serving Princess Emeraude...

00:20:03.326 --> 00:20:06.596
...Lantis had
disappeared from Cephiro.

00:20:08.466 --> 00:20:13.366
I never heard anything about
a younger brother from Zagato either.

00:20:14.006 --> 00:20:15.266
Me neither.

00:20:16.006 --> 00:20:20.166
And now, just as the Pillar
disappeared, he came back.

00:20:20.876 --> 00:20:23.146
Came back? From where?

00:20:23.776 --> 00:20:25.076
From Autozam.

00:20:25.186 --> 00:20:26.116
Autozam?

00:20:26.586 --> 00:20:27.546
Autozam?

00:20:48.806 --> 00:20:50.036
Soon...

00:20:50.976 --> 00:20:52.066
Soon.

00:20:53.106 --> 00:20:57.276
Now that it has no Pillar, the only
path Cephiro has is eradication.

00:20:57.376 --> 00:21:00.376
I am me, but at
the same time I am not.

00:21:00.486 --> 00:21:03.456
The people are
wishing for my existence.

00:21:25.706 --> 00:21:27.436
A-A dream?

00:21:32.186 --> 00:21:34.206
What was that dream?

00:21:41.526 --> 00:21:42.786
That was...

00:22:02.946 --> 00:22:08.346
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:09.016 --> 00:22:16.286
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:17.726 --> 00:22:23.286
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:23.996 --> 00:22:27.796
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:28.176 --> 00:22:30.536
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:32.376 --> 00:22:35.676
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:36.046 --> 00:22:39.376
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:39.816 --> 00:22:46.726
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:22:47.156 --> 00:22:50.556
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:22:50.896 --> 00:22:59.326
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:02.176 --> 00:23:05.506
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.746 --> 00:23:13.806
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:15.886 --> 00:23:22.686
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:31.106 --> 00:23:32.966
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:33.666 --> 00:23:37.536
I keep having weird dreams
ever since we arrived in Cephiro.

00:23:38.006 --> 00:23:42.276
I woke up from a nightmare,
and unable to fall asleep again...

00:23:42.376 --> 00:23:45.646
...I walked around the castle
and bumped into Lantis.

00:23:45.746 --> 00:23:49.046
But suddenly, the battleship
from Autozam appeared...

00:23:49.586 --> 00:23:51.456
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:23:51.726 --> 00:23:54.156
The Magic Knights
and the Battleship NSX.

00:23:54.156 --> 00:23:55.156
The Magic Knights
and the Battleship NSX
The Magic Knights
and the Battleship NSX.

00:23:55.156 --> 00:23:57.156
The Magic Knights
and the Battleship NSX
You have to watch it!

00:23:57.156 --> 00:23:58.426
The Magic Knights
and the Battleship NSX

00:23:58.426 --> 00:24:05.296
Who is it today?

00:24:06.266 --> 00:24:08.326
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:08.436 --> 00:24:14.396
Look forward to the next episode!
